{"v":4,"catch":"飛向東京的天空！ 掌握陣法變化！","desc":"SCRAMBLE FORMATION是TAITO於1986年推出的射擊遊戲。\n駕駛你的幻影噴射機投入戰鬥，沿途捕獲敵機以實現編隊變化。\n編隊可以是空對空、空對地或兩者的混合，而匹配這些來對抗敵人是勝利的關鍵！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-11-30","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/52ffaf27044b079566da686de41a271b120c548119a60f224dec9e53010c1390.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/631773547c4db47d671be389dcec804f08f7751d2b0a6680852e556d23a092ca.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/799e78d28a70b932eab0862115c03a61439b6db78c34bdf9698bbeaf45e9015b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b30305aba322afc367e69dadaddbf23214be9169aeb1eb9b3524fc42d2c526f0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/923abf70c5a5f9948c97e2d8dace7ad757101dc7e529845887f6b53f6625e02b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e110d040811bba690798ee0fe985e4f61f6827c90c877fedba0645ab96a92b4a.jpg"],"titleId":"010091201cf8a000","dlc":[]}